%h2.mb-4 商品登録リクエスト一覧

- if @requests.any?
  .table-responsive
    %table.table.table-bordered.table-hover.table-sm.align-middle
      %thead.table-dark
        %tr
          %th 申請者
          %th カテゴリ
          %th 商品名
          %th 基本料金
          %th 状態
          %th 申請日時
          %th 操作
      %tbody
        - @requests.each do |req|
          %tr
            %td= req.user.name
            %td= req.item_category.name
            %td.fw-bold= req.name
            %td= "#{req.base_price}円"
            %td
              - if req.pending?
                %span.badge.bg-warning.text-dark 未対応
              - elsif req.approved?
                %span.badge.bg-success 承認済み
              - else
                %span.badge.bg-secondary 却下
            %td= req.created_at.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')
            %td
              - if req.pending?
                .d-flex.gap-2
                  = link_to '承認', new_admin_wholesale_stock_path(wholesale_item_request_id: req.id), class: 'btn btn-primary btn-sm'
                  = button_to '却下', reject_admin_wholesale_item_request_path(req), method: :post, class: 'btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm', data: { confirm: '却下しますか？' }
- else
  .alert.alert-info リクエストはまだありません。
